cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use qrng-attest, please cite it as below."
title: "qrng-attest"
abstract: >-
  Entropy assessment and device attestation for quantum random number generation on Qiskit backends: the
  NIST SP 800-90B assessment of the raw bits, a min-entropy bound from the readout calibration and the
  coherence of the source state measured in the X and Y bases, the output length for the shots taken
  together, and randomness extraction.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Nikolas
    family-names: Klein
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/NikoKleion/qrng-attest"
keywords:
  - quantum random number generation
  - min-entropy
  - NIST SP 800-90B
  - randomness extraction
  - Qiskit
